# Poster Paint Party (cavekit-flash.md R7): a colouring book. A colour picked and a part of the poster tapped: that
# part takes the colour (its picture changes) and a part not tapped keeps its picture (the lower left hills: the
# movie's brush follows the tap and hangs below it, so the untouched part is taken well away from it).
id: flash-app-paint
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the colouring book: a colour picked and the sky tapped, the sky's picture changes and the untouched ground's does not
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/poster-paint-party
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
wait still m 30
stage-tap m 480 320 232 287
wait still m 10
shoot poster
sample sky m@480,320:150,40,270,90
sample ground m@480,320:95,205,200,238
stage-tap m 480 320 159 288
pause 1200
stage-tap m 480 320 234 70
wait differs m@480,320:150,40,270,90 sky 6
expect region-changed m@480,320:150,40,270,90 sky
expect region-equal m@480,320:95,205,200,238 ground
shoot painted
